      "lines": [
        "55. 化成分式：",
        "а) $\\left(n+\\frac{1}{n}\\right)^2$；б) $\\left(\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{b}{a}\\right)^2$；",
        "в) $\\left(\\frac{x}{y}+1\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{x}{y}-1\\right)^2$；г) $\\left(\\frac{p}{q}+\\frac{q}{p}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{p}{q}-\\frac{q}{p}\\right)^2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "56",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "56. 化简：",
        "а) $\\frac{2-\\frac{a}{x}}{2+\\frac{a}{x}}$；б) $\\frac{\\frac{a-b}{c}+3}{\\frac{a+b}{c}-1}$；в) $\\frac{\\frac{2x-5}{y}-1}{\\frac{2x+5}{y}+1}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "57",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "57. 先作代换，再把所得到的式子化简：",
        "а) $\\frac{x-a}{x-b}$，其中 $x=\\frac{ab}{a+b}$；",
        "б) $\\frac{\\frac{a}{b}-x}{\\frac{b}{a}+x}$，其中 $x=\\frac{a-b}{a+b}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "58",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "58. 求下列函数的图象与 $x$ 轴和 $y$ 轴的交点坐标：",
        "а) $y=\\frac{1}{3}x-2$；б) $y=0.4x+2$。",
        "作出这两个函数的图象。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "59",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "59. 写出经过点 $(0,4)$ 且与直线 $y=3x$ 平行的直线方程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "60",
